# ---- CI build output ----
# The release workflows build with `--outdir dist-upload` so the uploaded artifact is
# exactly what the commit produced (dist/ holds historical releases on purpose). This
# directory is output, not source: a local `python -m build --outdir dist-upload` put a
# 1.2 MB wheel into the index once already.
dist-upload/
